37481:20.182 fo:background-color
37483:The fo:background-color attribute specifies a background color for characters, paragraphs, text sections, frames, page bodies, headers, footers, table cells, table rows and tables. This can be transparent or a color. If the value is set to transparent, it switches off any background image that is specified by a <style:background-image> 17.3.
37485:If a value for a draw:fill attribute is provided in a style, any background image that is specified by a <style:background-image> element and any background color that is specified with the fo:background-color attribute are switched off. 
